        },
        {
          "text": "Muri mwebge ni hagira ahazoba umukene mu b’i wanyu, mu gisagara canyu cose co mu gihugu Uhoraho Imana yanyu agiye kubaha, ntimuze mugire imitima yiyumanganya uwo mukene w’i wanyu, canke ngo mupfunye amaboko ku co mumuha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
