        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mwirinde, mu mitima yanyu ntihaze haze iciyumviro kibi, ngo muvuge muti Wa mwaka ugira indwi wo guheberanira uri hafi; bigatuma mwirengagiza kubg’ uwo mukene w’i wanyu, mukanka kugira ico mumuha; na we akazohava atakambira Uhoraho abarega, mukagībgako n’icaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
