                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ni yakubarira, ati Singomba kukuvako; kukw agukunda, agakunda n’urugo rwawe, kuko mumeraniye neza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uze wābīre umugera, uwumutoboze ugutwi urume mu rugi, aze yame ar’ umugurano wawe ibihe vyose. No ku muguranokazi wawe na we az’ abe ari k’ubigenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ho ni wamurekura ngw agire umwidegemvyo, ntibize bikubabaze, kukw azoba yagukoreye imyaka itandatu; kand’ iy’ aba umucangero, yari gutwara ibingana kabiri n’ivyo wakoresheje kubgiwe: maz’ Uhoraho Imana yawe azoguha umugisha mu vy’ ukora vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
