            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze murobanurire Uhoraho Imana yanyu uburiza bgose bg’icitwa ishuri buvuka mu masho yanyu no mu mikuku yanyu: ntimuze mugire igikorwa na kimwe mukoresha ic’ uburiza bgo mu masho yanyu, canke ngo mukēmūre ic’ uburiza bgo mu mikuku yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
